003">丁</span></p><p begin="38.245" end="42.026" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.245" end="38.730">我</span><span begin="38.730" end="39.242">只有</span><span begin="39.242" end="40.144">一个</span><span begin="40.144" end="40.642">蓝</span><span begin="40.642" end="41.138">色的</span><span begin="41.138" end="41.533">感</span><span begin="41.533" end="42.026">觉</span></p><p begin="42.400" end="47.169" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.400" end="42.936">不要</span><span begin="42.936" end="44.312">问我为</span><span begin="44.312" end="45.176">什</span><span begin="45.176" end="47.169">么</span></p></div><div begin="47.475" end="1:02.271" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="47.475" end="50.840" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.475" end="47.958">很</span><span begin="47.958" end="48.227">想</span><span begin="48.227" end="50.840">说</span></p><p begin="51.123" end="54.883" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.123" end="51.696">但</span><span begin="51.696" end="51.950">又</span><span begin="51.950" end="52.441">觉</span><span begin="52.441" end="53.385">得没有话</span><span begin="53.385" end="53.766">好</span><span begin="53.766" end="54.883">说</span></p><p begin="55.357" end="58.659" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="55.357" end="55.869">我只</span><span begin="55.869" end="57.192">恨我自</span><span begin="57.192" end="58.659">己</span></p><p begin="59.001" end="1:02.271" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.001" end="59.476">逃不</span><span begin="59.476" end="1:00.886">出这监</span><span begin="1:00.886" end="1:02.271">狱</span></p></div><div begin="1:02.281" end="1:17.965" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="1:02.281" end="1:05.564" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.281" end="1:02.705">或</span><span begin="1:02.705" end="1:03.030">许</span><span begin="1:03.030" end="1:05.564">我</span></p><p begin="1:05.876" end="1:09.721" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.876" end="1:06.393">是</span><span b